!Name: p90backlwss-1
!C A period 90 c/3 backward LWSS rake.
!C This uses a period 90 c/3 rake, a period 45 c/3 rake, and a slightly
!C dirty forward glider to backward LWSS conversion convoy.  This is an
!C improvement on a previous version of the rake.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
